export anchor PrivateWealthStyle:
    number: 364
    screen: FinanceBudget
    name: Private wealth
    idea: A discreet private client statement in near black, with fine gold double rules, serif old style figures, a centred monogram and a framed goal arc, so money reads as quiet and well kept.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #0e1013, the page and the style sheet
        surface: #14171b, kept for hover rows
        gold: #c9a961, every rule, meter fills, the goal arc and the primary button
        goldText: #d9bf85, the brand, section heads, links, Fully drawn and focus
        line: #3a352a, hairlines between rows and meter tracks
        ink: #ece6d8, text and figures
        muted: #a8a193, labels, dates and notes
        within: #b0cba8, Within and money received
        exceeded: #eba496, Exceeded, the owed card balance and overspend hatching
        onGold: #17140c, text on the gold button
    type:
        Headings and figures use Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino,
        Book Antiqua, Georgia with old style numerals. Labels use system-ui,
        Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial. Base 15px at 1.6. The title is
        40px at 400, centred. Holding figures are 38px serif with a small gold
        euro sign. Section heads are 17px serif small caps tracked .16em in gold
        text. Category names are 18px serif. Labels are 12px sans caps tracked
        .16em.
    layout:
        A centred 1040px statement. The masthead is a three part row, the brand
        in gold small caps on the left, a round gold ringed MO monogram in the
        centre and Mara Okafor with October statement in euros on the right,
        ruled below by a gold line with a dark hairline under it. Four tracked
        caps nav links sit centred below, Overview underlined in gold. The
        centred title Your October position has an italic note under it. A
        Holdings band follows, ruled gold above and below, holding three centred
        columns split by hairlines, Everyday account, Savings, and Credit card
        in rose with a clock and Owed, due 12 November. Below, a wide column
        holds the October allocations table with category, a hairline track with
        a 3px gold fill and a white tick at the limit, spent of limit, and a
        standing word on the right. A narrow column holds The goal in a double
        gold frame with a thin gold semicircle arc at 64 percent, 3,200 of 5,000
        saved, 1,800 remaining and the target date. Recent movements runs full
        width as a ruled list with date, serif payee and the amount with an
        arrow. A gold ruled footer closes the statement. Below 760px holdings
        stack, the table rows become two line blocks with the bar under them and
        the goal moves under the table.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px gutter, 56px between bands, 24 to 28px inside holdings.
    density:
        Low. Three holdings, five allocations, five movements and one goal with
        plenty of air.
    corners: None, except the round monogram and round swatches.
    borders:
        Gold 1px rules round the holdings and under the masthead, dark gold
        hairlines between rows, a double frame round the goal.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Few and thin, 1em outline shapes beside words. A circle check for
        Within, a ruled square for Fully drawn, a triangle for Exceeded by 62,
        up and down arrows for movements and a clock for the due date. The
        overspent track turns into rose dashes past the limit tick.
    focus:
        A 1px gold text outline offset 4px with a second gold ring outside a
        page coloured gap.
    tone:
        Formal and discreet, such as Your October position, Holdings,
        Allocations, Recent movements and Exceeded by 62.
